# code `ra0` cannot: it is the only one with a RANGE and an END, so `loops`, the
# loop-interval append, `used_in_loop`, `sorted_uses`, `live_ins` and the
# epilogue's `fill` are DEAD CODE on `ra0` and `ra1`.
